# The documentation site's toolchain. docs/requirements.txt pins it, with hashes, for Linux and Python 3.12 as CI runs it:
#
#     uv pip compile docs/requirements.in --python-platform linux --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes -o docs/requirements.txt
#
# MkDocs 2 drops the plugin and theme system Material is built on, so both stay on their 1.x and 9.x lines.
